<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns Aaa to TEPCO Eurobonds.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns Aaa to TEPCO Eurobonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Friday that it had assigned an Aaa rating to Tokyo Electric Power Co Inc's (TEPCO) $500 million 7.125 percent Eurobonds due 2007.</p>
<p>The rating is based on the utility firm's importance to the national economy and the very favourable industry environment it operates under, Moody's said in a statement.</p>
</text>
